fixture tech10_crouch_dash_long_gap
doc BUILD.md s5 Ground "Crouch: cannot move"; s5 tech 10 crouch-dash; docs/adr/0010 level rule "a crouch-only gap is at most one crouch-dash long" (director question)
room test/longgap
spawn 600 544
frames 80
input
  0..2 D
  3 D dash
  4..26 R
  # Once the cooldown ends, a second crouch-dash (stick still down) gets the player out.
  27 D dash
  28..79 R
end
expect
  at 3 event.dash=1 crouch=1
  # A 384 u gap is longer than one crouch-dash: crouched under the ceiling the player cannot move
  # until the ground dash cooldown lets a second crouch-dash out (rooms must not do this).
  during 19..26 vx=0 crouch=1 x=x@19
  at 27 event.dash=1 crouch=1
  mark out 28..79 crouch=0
  at out x>1024u
end
